    Bug 1944982 - Account Hub position select all button relative with negative margin to keep correct position with font-size increase. r=aleca

    **How to Test**
    - Get to the calendar and address book sync stage of the email setup
    - Ensure the select all/deselect all button is aligned
    - Open developer console and apply font-size style to containing html element, testing from 12px to 22px

    This patch does not fix the underlying issue of each list changing sizes with the increased font-size.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D236783

